# Workflows

This folder holds [agents.wf](https://github.com/romanlv/agentswf) workflows: TypeScript files
that run coding agents, started with `awf`.

- A workflow is a folder with a `workflow.ts`, which default-exports
  `defineWorkflow(…)` from `agentswf/workflow`, and a `workflow.test.ts` beside it.
  `hello/` is the smallest one; copy it to start another.
- The API, with every option and outcome:
  https://github.com/romanlv/agentswf/blob/main/docs/workflow-api.md
- `awf test` runs the tests with each agent replaced by scripted answers: no agent starts, and it
  costs nothing. After a change, run it and `bun run check`, which typechecks.
- `awf run hello/workflow.ts` starts real agents, on the operator's accounts. Don't run a workflow
  unless asked.
- Each run is kept in `.awf/runs/{workflow}/{id}`. `awf runs` lists them; `awf logs {run}` shows
  what one did.
